<p>Light browns are making a resurgence in cabinetry and interiors, and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a> and <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a> keep releasing stains to match the natural trends of 2026. The newest: <strong>Maple Honey</strong>, a light-brown stain on maple.</p>

