  <img src="/images/blog/maple-honey-stain/maple-honey-vs-natural-golden-pebble.webp" alt="Landes door in Maple Honey stain above chip samples of Maple Natural, Maple Golden, and Maple Pebble for comparison" width="1257" height="1843" fetchpriority="high" />
